{'symbol': 'GRMN', 'date': '2022-06-13 08:40:00', 'title': 'GARMIN AGAIN PREVAILS IN PHILIPS PATENT CAMPAIGN', 'text': "OLATHE, KAN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GARMIN INTERNATIONAL, INC., A UNIT OF GARMIN LTD. (NYSE: GRMN), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS SECURED ANOTHER VICTORY IN PHILIPS NORTH AMERICA LLC AND KONINKLIJKE PHILIPS NV'S GLOBAL PATENT LAWSUIT CAMPAIGN. ON JUNE 8, 2022, JUDGE ANDRÉ BIROTTE JR. OF THE U.S. DISTRICT COURT FOR THE CENTRAL DISTRICT OF CALIFORNIA SUMMARILY DISMISSED A PHILIPS LAWSUIT AGAINST GARMIN ON THE BASIS THAT ONE OF PHILIPS' REMAINING ASSERTED PATENTS WAS INVALID AND THE OTHER DID NOT COVER G"}